  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n21 × [(9 - 4) ÷ {(8 ÷ 8 of 4) + (4 ÷ 4 of 2)}]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n21 × [(9 - 4) ÷ {(8 ÷ 8 of 4) + (4 ÷ 4 of 2)}]\n\n⇒ 21 × [(9 - 4) ÷ {(8 ÷ 32) + (4 ÷ 8)}]\n\n⇒ 21 × [5 ÷ {1/4 + 1/2}]\n\n⇒ 21 × [5 ÷ 3/4]\n\n⇒ 21 × 20/3\n\n⇒ 140\n\n**∴ Required answer is 140**",
